    "body": "Relay BB run pushed an update.\n\nPull request: #352\n\nTokens: 0 · Cost: $0.0000\n\nPushed to branch `bb/relay-234-auth-v1-07-08-add-the-setup-web-wizard-thr_aqybchfr48` (same branch as PR #352).\n\n## Summary\n\nAddressed the code-review finding on PR #352: `web/src/api/setupOperations.ts`'s success path cast the response body with `as { user?: unknown }` without validating the outer envelope, so a non-object JSON response (`null`, a bare string, an array) would throw a raw `TypeError` instead of a clean validation error. Fixed by parsing the whole `{ user: publicUserSchema }` envelope through one zod schema, and added a regression test covering a `null` response body.\n\n## Test plan\n\n- [x] `web`: lint, format:check, build, test (138/138)\n- [x] `backend`: lint, format:check, build, test:unit (114/114), check:pi-import-paths, check-migration-numbering, check:boundaries, test:integration (741/741), test:e2e (5/5)\n\nRelay-Step-Status: pass",
